nc\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https:\/\/ishabeauty.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/pexels-arina-krasnikova-6663574-1024x683.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3035\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ishabeauty.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/pexels-arina-krasnikova-6663574-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/ishabeauty.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/pexels-arina-krasnikova-6663574-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/ishabeauty.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/pexels-arina-krasnikova-6663574-768x513.jpg 768w, https:\/\/ishabeauty.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/pexels-arina-krasnikova-6663574-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/ishabeauty.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/pexels-arina-krasnikova-6663574-2048x1367.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/ishabeauty.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/pexels-arina-krasnikova-6663574-1000x667.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-f0b8c93\" data-id=\"f0b8c93\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-85cf2ea elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"85cf2ea\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Qurat-ul-Aein <\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-257341e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"257341e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Senior Beauty Therapist<\/h6>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3875a6f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3875a6f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Qurat ul Ayn is a Senior Beauty Therapist at Isha Salon, known for her exceptional skills, professionalism, and passion for the beauty industry. With years of experience, Qurat ul Ayn has honed her expertise in various beauty treatments, offering a holistic approach to skincare and wellness. She is dedicated to enhancing the natural beauty of her clients while providing them with personalized and transformative beauty experiences.<\/p><p>Having worked with a wide range of clients, Qurat ul Ayn brings a deep understanding of different skin types and beauty needs. She specializes in a variety of treatments, including facials, skin rejuvenation, eyebrow shaping, and advanced skincare therapies. Her meticulous attention to detail and commitment to using high-quality products ensure that each client receives a tailored experience that addresses their specific concerns and goals.<\/p><p>Her ability to blend traditional beauty techniques with modern innovations sets her apart in the beauty industry. Qurat ul Ayn stays up-to-date with the latest trends and treatments, always striving to expand her knowledge and expertise to provide clients with the best possible care. Her approach emphasizes not only aesthetic results but also long-term skin health, with a focus on achieving glowing, youthful, and healthy skin.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-84d04d9 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"84d04d9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-2a1b720d elementor-section-content-middle wdt-section-wrap-col elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"2a1b720d\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-wider\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-7b863a\" data-id=\"7b863a\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-22e12aa6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"22e12aa6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">\nGagandeep Kaur <\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2c31b226 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2c31b226\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Junior Beauty Therapist and\u00a0Hair\u00a0Dresser<\/h6>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-406d14cc elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"406d14cc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Gagandeep Kaur is a Junior Beauty Therapist and Hairdresser at Isha Salon, where she brings her passion for beauty and wellness to life through exceptional hair and skincare services. With a natural flair for beauty and an eagerness to learn, Gagandeep has quickly become a valued member of the Isha Salon team.<\/p><p>Gagandeep specializes in a range of beauty and hairdressing treatments, offering clients personalized services that enhance their natural features. As a Junior Beauty Therapist, she provides various skincare treatments, focusing on maintaining healthy, glowing skin through facials, exfoliation, and personalized skincare advice. Her attention to detail ensures that each client receives the care they need for their skin type and beauty goals.<\/p><p>In addition to her expertise in beauty therapy, Gagandeep is skilled in hairdressing, offering services such as haircuts, styling, blowouts, and basic hair treatments. She is committed to delivering the best results by staying up-to-date with the latest trends and techniques in the hair industry. Gagandeep\u2019s passion for both beauty therapy and hairdressing allows her to create an all-around positive experience for clients, whether they are looking for a rejuvenating facial or a stylish new haircut.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-389dcdcb elementor-invisible\" data-id=\"389dcdcb\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d159e43 animated-fast elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"d159e43\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;slideInRight&quot;,&quot;_